From 6fcdd6183703768a2f4ed1cc48380eaa50da547c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 15:10:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(launch): reserve private backing FDs without widening
 public limits

Capture the operator public descriptor capacity before reserving bounded
storage backing. Raise only the supervisor soft limit within the existing
hard limit, and apply the captured public capacity to the workload.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
---
